{"id":"805dfef75468c832","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-edge-expanded-trs.md","title":"保留collapsing历史的边扩展系统","display":"df-edge-expanded-trs — 保留collapsing历史的边扩展系统","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-edge-expanded-trs","aliases":["56-df-edge-expanded-trs"],"display":"df-edge-expanded-trs — 保留collapsing历史的边扩展系统","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","[[56-df-typed-redex-pattern]]","[[56-df-relation-closure]]","[[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]]"],"source_section":"§8.6 Definition 8.6.64; Examples 8.6.63, 8.6.65","source_printed_pages":"410–411","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; selected-source-pages-rendered; explicit-coding-local","source_proof_status":"source-argument-expanded-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-edge-expanded-trs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-edge-expanded-trs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-edge-expanded-trs — 保留collapsing历史的边扩展系统"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b6aaae6fd581d4f1\" href=\"?note=b6aaae6fd581d4f1\" title=\"56-df-typed-redex-pattern\">56-df-typed-redex-pattern</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d7d212169855cb94\" href=\"?note=d7d212169855cb94\" title=\"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite\">56-df-signature-relative-rewrite</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.6 Definition 8.6.64; Examples 8.6.63, 8.6.65"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"410–411"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; selected-source-pages-rendered; explicit-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-argument-expanded-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}),\\mathcal V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V),R\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}),\\mathcal V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V),R\\)</span>，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a> 的普通TRS条件，且每个左项线性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\notin\\mathcal F\\cup\\mathcal V\">\\(e\\notin\\mathcal F\\cup\\mathcal V\\)</span> 为新的元数1符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FPos},\\operatorname{TPos},E,V,W,\\epsilon\">\\(\\operatorname{FPos},\\operatorname{TPos},E,V,W,\\epsilon\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b6aaae6fd581d4f1\" href=\"?note=b6aaae6fd581d4f1\" title=\"56-df-typed-redex-pattern\">56-df-typed-redex-pattern</a>。下面用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 表示项扩展函数，与位置构造器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 区分。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FPos}_{\\Sigma^e}\">\\(\\operatorname{FPos}_{\\Sigma^e}\\)</span> 是FPos在新签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^e\">\\(\\Sigma^e\\)</span> 的项集上的实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in T^e\">\\(X\\in T^e\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\operatorname{EC}(t)\">\\(K\\in\\operatorname{EC}(t)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)\">\\(p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X\">\\(\\pi_X\\)</span> 的非根递归分支局部取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(X)\">\\(q\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\cdot(i)\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(X)\">\\(q\\cdot(i)\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(X)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d7d212169855cb94\" href=\"?note=d7d212169855cb94\" title=\"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite\">56-df-signature-relative-rewrite</a> 的显式签名接口；辅助一步关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_{D_e}\">\\(\\to_{D_e}\\)</span> 在下文于载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^e\">\\(T^e\\)</span> 上定义，其星闭包取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a> 在同一载体上的构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x_0\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 是固定变量，仅用于生成辅助扩展关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^e\\coloneqq(\\mathcal F\\cup\\{e\\},\\operatorname{ar}\\cup\\{(e,1)\\}),\\qquad T^e\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma^e,\\mathcal V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^e\\coloneqq(\\mathcal F\\cup\\{e\\},\\operatorname{ar}\\cup\\{(e,1)\\}),\\qquad T^e\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma^e,\\mathcal V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e^{[0]}(X)\\coloneqq X,\\qquad e^{[k+1]}(X)\\coloneqq e(e^{[k]}(X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e^{[0]}(X)\\coloneqq X,\\qquad e^{[k+1]}(X)\\coloneqq e(e^{[k]}(X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EC}(t)\\coloneqq\\{K\\in\\mathbb N^{\\operatorname{FPos}(t)}:\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{FPos}(t)\\;[(p=\\epsilon\\land K(p)=0)\\lor(p\\ne\\epsilon\\land K(p)&gt;0)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EC}(t)\\coloneqq\\{K\\in\\mathbb N^{\\operatorname{FPos}(t)}:\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{FPos}(t)\\;[(p=\\epsilon\\land K(p)=0)\\lor(p\\ne\\epsilon\\land K(p)&gt;0)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_{t,K}(p)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x&amp;t|_p=x\\in\\mathcal V,\\\\ e^{[K(p)]}\\bigl(f(B_{t,K}(p\\cdot(1)),\\ldots,B_{t,K}(p\\cdot(n)))\\bigr)&amp;t|_p=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mathcal E_K^0(t)\\coloneqq B_{t,K}(\\epsilon).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_{t,K}(p)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x&amp;t|_p=x\\in\\mathcal V,\\\\ e^{[K(p)]}\\bigl(f(B_{t,K}(p\\cdot(1)),\\ldots,B_{t,K}(p\\cdot(n)))\\bigr)&amp;t|_p=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mathcal E_K^0(t)\\coloneqq B_{t,K}(\\epsilon).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K_t^0\\coloneqq\\{(\\epsilon,0):\\epsilon\\in\\operatorname{FPos}(t)\\}\\cup\\{(p,1):p\\in\\operatorname{FPos}(t)\\setminus\\{\\epsilon\\}\\},\\qquad\\mathcal E_0(t)\\coloneqq\\mathcal E_{K_t^0}^0(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K_t^0\\coloneqq\\{(\\epsilon,0):\\epsilon\\in\\operatorname{FPos}(t)\\}\\cup\\{(p,1):p\\in\\operatorname{FPos}(t)\\setminus\\{\\epsilon\\}\\},\\qquad\\mathcal E_0(t)\\coloneqq\\mathcal E_{K_t^0}^0(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E(x)\\coloneqq e(x),\\qquad\\mathcal E(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq e(f(\\mathcal E(t_1),\\ldots,\\mathcal E(t_n))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal E(x)\\coloneqq e(x),\\qquad\\mathcal E(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq e(f(\\mathcal E(t_1),\\ldots,\\mathcal E(t_n))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C(x)\\coloneqq x,\\quad\\mathcal C(e(X))\\coloneqq\\mathcal C(X),\\quad\\mathcal C(f(X_1,\\ldots,X_n))\\coloneqq f(\\mathcal C(X_1),\\ldots,\\mathcal C(X_n))\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C(x)\\coloneqq x,\\quad\\mathcal C(e(X))\\coloneqq\\mathcal C(X),\\quad\\mathcal C(f(X_1,\\ldots,X_n))\\coloneqq f(\\mathcal C(X_1),\\ldots,\\mathcal C(X_n))\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^e\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathcal E_K^0(l),\\mathcal E_0(r)):(l,r)\\in R,\\ r\\notin\\mathcal V,\\ K\\in\\operatorname{EC}(l)\\}\\cup\\{(\\mathcal E_K^0(l),e(r)):(l,r)\\in R,\\ r\\in\\mathcal V,\\ K\\in\\operatorname{EC}(l)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^e\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathcal E_K^0(l),\\mathcal E_0(r)):(l,r)\\in R,\\ r\\notin\\mathcal V,\\ K\\in\\operatorname{EC}(l)\\}\\cup\\{(\\mathcal E_K^0(l),e(r)):(l,r)\\in R,\\ r\\in\\mathcal V,\\ K\\in\\operatorname{EC}(l)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_e\\coloneqq\\{(e(x_0),e(e(x_0)))\\},\\qquad\\to_{D_e}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma^e,\\mathcal V,D_e),\\qquad\\operatorname{Exp}(t)\\coloneqq\\{X\\in T^e:\\mathcal E(t)\\to_{D_e}^{*}X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_e\\coloneqq\\{(e(x_0),e(e(x_0)))\\},\\qquad\\to_{D_e}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma^e,\\mathcal V,D_e),\\qquad\\operatorname{Exp}(t)\\coloneqq\\{X\\in T^e:\\mathcal E(t)\\to_{D_e}^{*}X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X(\\epsilon)\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\pi_X(q\\cdot(i))\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\pi_X(q)&amp;\\operatorname{root}(X|_q)=e,\\\\\\pi_X(q)\\cdot(i)&amp;\\operatorname{root}(X|_q)\\in\\mathcal F,\\end{cases}\\quad(q\\cdot(i)\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_X(\\epsilon)\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\pi_X(q\\cdot(i))\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\pi_X(q)&amp;\\operatorname{root}(X|_q)=e,\\\\\\pi_X(q)\\cdot(i)&amp;\\operatorname{root}(X|_q)\\in\\mathcal F,\\end{cases}\\quad(q\\cdot(i)\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Vis}(t)\\coloneqq\\{V(p):p\\in\\operatorname{FPos}(t)\\}\\cup\\{E(p):p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Vis}(t)\\coloneqq\\{V(p):p\\in\\operatorname{FPos}(t)\\}\\cup\\{E(p):p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rep}_X(z)\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\operatorname{FPos}_{\\Sigma^e}(X):[\\operatorname{root}(X|_q)=e\\land z=E(\\pi_X(q))]\\lor[\\operatorname{root}(X|_q)\\in\\mathcal F\\land z=V(\\pi_X(q))]\\}\\quad(z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\mathcal C(X))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Rep}_X(z)\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\operatorname{FPos}_{\\Sigma^e}(X):[\\operatorname{root}(X|_q)=e\\land z=E(\\pi_X(q))]\\lor[\\operatorname{root}(X|_q)\\in\\mathcal F\\land z=V(\\pi_X(q))]\\}\\quad(z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\mathcal C(X))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{epos}_t\\coloneqq\\{(z,q):z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(t),\\ q\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{\\mathcal E(t)}(z)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{epos}_t\\coloneqq\\{(z,q):z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(t),\\ q\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{\\mathcal E(t)}(z)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{epos}_t:\\operatorname{Vis}(t)\\to\\operatorname{FPos}_{\\Sigma^e}(\\mathcal E(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{epos}_t:\\operatorname{Vis}(t)\\to\\operatorname{FPos}_{\\Sigma^e}(\\mathcal E(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>项的初始扩展在函数和变量子项之前都插入一个e；规则侧的扩展不在根或变量之前插入e，变量的实例本来携带入边。内部非变量位置允许任意正数条e，使左项可匹配collapsing步骤积累的边栈。变量右项改为e(x)，使被收缩模式的历史有保存位置。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_e\">\\(D_e\\)</span> 仅定义“进一步扩展”，不属于实际系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^e\">\\(R^e\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>所有构造沿有限项树递归；EC对变量项的唯一元素为空函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 删除经过e时的路径分量，Rep把原函数顶点映到原顶点，把所有e顶点映到相应原边；同一边可有多个代表。规范源 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E(t)\">\\(\\mathcal E(t)\\)</span> 的每个可见位置恰有一个代表，所以epos是函数。变量顶点不带Lévy标签，故Vis显式排除它们；这不丢失任何红项模式位置。以上唯一性也在后续边扩展保持命题中断言。</p>\n<p>已读原书定义及说明，并实际渲染核对印刷第410页（DjVu物理第433页）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_K^0\">\\(\\mathcal E_K^0\\)</span>、Rep与epos是对原书无限边饱和及expanded-position构造的显式编码；不是新增重写规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-typed-redex-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"b6aaae6fd581d4f1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-typed-redex-pattern]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"d7d212169855cb94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}),\\mathcal V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V),R$，满足 [[56-df-rewrite-system]] 的普通TRS条件，且每个左项线性。$e\\notin\\mathcal F\\cup\\mathcal V$ 为新的元数1符号；$\\operatorname{FPos},\\operatorname{TPos},E,V,W,\\epsilon$ 见 [[56-df-typed-redex-pattern]]。下面用 $\\mathcal E$ 表示项扩展函数，与位置构造器 $E$ 区分。$\\operatorname{FPos}_{\\Sigma^e}$ 是FPos在新签名 $\\Sigma^e$ 的项集上的实例。$t\\in T$；$X\\in T^e$；$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$K\\in\\operatorname{EC}(t)$；$p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)$。$\\pi_X$ 的非根递归分支局部取 $q\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(X)$、$i\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$ 且 $q\\cdot(i)\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(X)$。$\\operatorname{Red}$ 采用 [[56-df-signature-relat